Derived work
------------
The core mask encoding (Topology.CoreMask) and the PSM margin read/write
sequence replicate the logic of:

  Lenovo Legion Toolkit - GPL-3.0
  https://github.com/LenovoLegionToolkit-Team/LenovoLegionToolkit
  LenovoLegionToolkit.Lib/Overclocking/Amd/AmdOverclockingController.cs

The y-cruncher stress configuration, the periodic thread suspension and the
error criteria follow CoreCycler (sp00n/corecycler, GPL-3.0).

The NVIDIA V/F curve code (src/Rycolab.Core/Gpu: the private NvAPI function
ids and buffer layouts, the batched write with per-point fallback and
readback, the Blackwell tail flatten, and the safety-lock rule after a
driver reset) is ported from:

  Green Curve - MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 aufkrawall
  https://github.com/aufkrawall/green-curve
  source/vf_backends.cpp, gpu_backend.cpp, main_runtime_gpu.cpp,
  gpu_backend_apply.cpp, main_service_persist.cpp

